#. Tag: title
#: advanced-use.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Macros"
msgstr "Makroi"

#. Tag: para
#: advanced-use.docbook:21
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Macros are used to automate some type of calls. The basic use case is to "
"assign a phone number to a keyboard shortcut. To do so, a new macro have to "
"be created in the configuration dialog \"accessibility\" section. It can "
"then be assigned to a shortcut either in the dialog itself or in the "
"dedicated shortcut dialog. It is also possible add a macro to the toolbar "
"using the dedicated dialog."
msgstr ""
"Makroi su korišteni za automatizaciju nekih tipova poziva. Osnovna upotreba "
"je za dodjelu telefonskog broja kratici na tastaturi. Da biste to uradili, "
"novi makro mora biti kreiran u konfiguracijskom dijalogu odjeljku "
"prisupačnost. Može biti dodjeljen unutar samog dijaloga ili u posebnom "
"dijalogu za kraticu. Također je moguće dodati makro u alatnu traku "
"korištenjem posvećenog sijaloga."

#. Tag: para
#: advanced-use.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Macros also support the \"\\n\" escape sequence to emulate the effect of the "
"\"Enter\" keyboard key and the \"Pick up\" button. The time between each "
"keystroke is also configurable to match some PXB dial plan configuration "
"(such as phone extensions or audio menu)."
msgstr ""
"Makroi podržavaju ''\\n\" izlazni unos za poništavanje ''Enter'' tipke na "
"tastaturi i ''Prihvati'' tipke. Vrijeme između svakog pritiska tipke je "
"podesivo da se upari sa PXB  konfiguracijom biranja,(kao što su dodaci "
"pozivima ili audio meni)."

#. Tag: title
#: advanced-use.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Codecs"
msgstr "Kodeci"

#. Tag: para
#: advanced-use.docbook:32
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To communicate voice information, &sflphone; uses some codecs. You can "
#| "choose which codec to use in the audio configuration panel."
msgid ""
"To communicate voice information, &Ring; uses some codecs. You can choose "
"which codec to use in the audio configuration panel."
msgstr ""
"Za glasovnu komunikaciju, &sflphone; koristi neke kodeke Možete odabrati "
"kodek koji želite koristiti u audio onfiguracijskom panelu."

#. Tag: para
#: advanced-use.docbook:35
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In this panel you will see the codecs available on your system with all "
#| "their parameters. &sflphone; will use the first activated one in the "
#| "list. So you can change the order of the list, and activate/deactivate "
#| "some ones, to change which one will be used. To do that, select a codec "
#| "and click on the up/down arrows, or just check/uncheck the corresponding "
#| "checkbox."
msgid ""
"In this panel you will see the codecs available on your system with all "
"their parameters. &Ring; will use the first activated one in the list. So "
"you can change the order of the list, and activate/deactivate some ones, to "
"change which one will be used. To do that, select a codec and click on the "
"up/down arrows, or just check/uncheck the corresponding checkbox."
msgstr ""
"U ovom panelu vidjećete dostupne kodeke na vašem  sistemu sa njihovim "
"parametrima.&sflphone; će koristiti privi aktivni na listi. Tako da možete "
"promjeniti redoslijed na listi, i aktivirati/deativirati neke, da biste "
"promjenili koji će biti korišteni. Da to uradite, odaberite kodek i kliknite "
"na gore/dole strelice, ili jednostavno označite/odznačite pripadajući "
"kvadratić sa oznakom."

#. Tag: title
#: advanced-use.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

#. Tag: para
#: advanced-use.docbook:44
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&sflphone; versions higher than 1.1.2 have built in support for video "
#| "calls. This feature work mostly the same way as the audio codecs. An "
#| "option as also available to disable video transmission."
msgid ""
"&Ring; versions higher than 1.1.2 have built in support for video calls. "
"This feature work mostly the same way as the audio codecs. An option as also "
"available to disable video transmission."
msgstr ""
"&sflphone; verzije novije od 1.1.2 imaju ugrađenu podršku za video pozive. "
"Ovaj dodatak većinom radi na isti način kao i u audio kodecima. Dostupna je "
"opcija za omogućavanje i onemogućavanje video prenosa."

#. Tag: para
#: advanced-use.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"During a video call, some display options are available to change the aspect "
"ratio or rotate the video. By pressing the advanced settings button, it is "
"also possible to switch from different camera, disable video, stream a file "
"or share your screen(s). Sharing a file is also accessible by drag and "
"dropping it on top of the video window."
msgstr ""
"Tokom video poziva neke opcije za ekran su dostupne za promjenu razmjere i "
"rataciju videa. Pritiskanjem tipke za napredne opcije, moguće je prebacivati "
"na različite kaere, onemogućiti video, stream dokumenta ili dijeljenje "
"ekrana. Dijeljenje dokumenta je moguće putem povuci i spusti opcije na vrhu "
"video poziva."

#. Tag: para
#: advanced-use.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Video devices settings can be configured from the configuration window "
"\"video\" section."
msgstr ""
"Postavke video uređaja su moguće u konfiguracijskom prozoru ,,video'' "
"odjeljka."

#~ msgid "Hooks"
#~ msgstr "Kvake"

#, fuzzy
#~| msgid ""
#~| "An interesting feature of &sflphone; is the hook handle. Hooks designate "
#~| "some actions you can choose to trigger on a particular signal, "
#~| "especially when receiving or sending a call. The two useful hooks that "
#~| "are implemented in &sflphone; are the URL argument, and the phone number "
#~| "formatting."
#~ msgid ""
#~ "An interesting feature of &Ring; is the hook handle. Hooks designate some "
#~ "actions you can choose to trigger on a particular signal, especially when "
#~ "receiving or sending a call. The two useful hooks that are implemented in "
#~ "&Ring; are the URL argument, and the phone number formatting."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Interesantan dodatak u &sflphone; je rukovanje kvakom. Kvake označavaju "
#~ "neke akcije koje želite aktivirati nekim signalom, pogotovo pri prijemu i "
#~ "slanju pozival. Dvije korisne kvake su implementirane u &sflphone; jedna "
#~ "je URL argument a drug formatiranje telefonskog broja."

#~ msgid "URL argument"
#~ msgstr "URL argument"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This feature permits you to grab an URL sent in a particular header of "
#~ "the SIP or IAX message sent by Asterisk server, and execute it with the "
#~ "chosen browser command."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ovaj dodatak vam omogućava kopiranje URL poslanog u poebnom zaglavlju SIP "
#~ "ili IAX poruke poslane Asteriks serverom, i izvršava ih pomoću zadane "
#~ "pretraživačke komande."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "To configure it, go to the <guilabel>Hooks</guilabel> page of the "
#~ "configuration menu. Then check the SIP or/and IAX checkbox, if you want "
#~ "to enable hooks with SIP accounts or/and with IAX accounts. Then type the "
#~ "name of custom header that your Asterisk server inserts into the invite "
#~ "message for the SIP protocol (if you do not know the name of the custom "
#~ "header, ask the one who configured the Asterisk server). For IAX there is "
#~ "a common header for that, so you do not have to configure it. Then type "
#~ "the command of the browser you want to have the URL opened with, or leave "
#~ "x-www-browser for the default browser."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Da ga podesite idite na <guilabel>Hooks</guilabel> stranicu "
#~ "konfiguracijskog menija. Onda povjerite SIP ili/i IAX kvadratić sa "
#~ "oznakom, ako želite omogućiti kvake sa SIP računima ili/i sa IAX "
#~ "računima. Onda unesite ime zaglavlja koje vaš Asterisk server ubacuje u "
#~ "pozivnicu za SIP protokol (ako neznate naziv zaglavlja, pitajte nekoga ko "
#~ "je konfigursao Asterisk server).Za IAX postoji zajedničko zaglavlje za to,"
#~ "tako da ga ne morate postavljati. Onda unesite komandu pretraaživača "
#~ "pomoću kojeg želite otvoriti URL,  ili ostavite x-www-browser za zadani "
#~ "pretraživač."

#~ msgid "Phone number formattings"
#~ msgstr "Formatiranje telefonskog broja"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This feature permits you to add the chosen prefix at the beginning of the "
#~ "phone number you are calling."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ovaj dodatak vam omogućava da dodate izabrani prefiks na početak "
#~ "telefonskog broja koji pozivate."
